            3.1.3.2. Simplification via Douglas-Pecker algorithm
            3.1.3.3. Separate closed rings and open arcs
        3.1.4. Compute seeds
        3.1.5. Template graph identically applied to every slice
            3.1.5.1. Written as ASCII line file
